$welcome = @"
Welcome to the SpecterX Purview Integration Tool.

This guided tool performs:
  1) Check endpoint prerequisites
  2) Connect to Entra ID (Microsoft Graph)
  3) Create app registration
  4) Create client secret
  5) Grant permission and admin consent
